"content": "<h1>戶反，戶反族</h1><p>便雅憫人，也是戶反族的祖先（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"04026039\" data-end-ref=\"04026039\">民26:39</data>）；他可能與戶平（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01046021\" data-end-ref=\"01046021\">創46:21</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13007012\" data-end-ref=\"13007015\">代上7:12、15</data>，又譯戶品）和戶蘭（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13008005\" data-end-ref=\"13008005\">代上8:5</data>）是同一人。</p><p><em>另見</em> <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"908706\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\" data-language=\"zht\">戶平</data>；<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"5951\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\" data-language=\"eng\">戶蘭#1</data>。</p>",
